Understand the Main Problem

Normally in traditional Airflow:
    Scheduler runs tasks
    Workers execute tasks
    Everything is usually inside one environment

So:
    Airflow Scheduler + Workers + Data
            ALL TOGETHER
This becomes a problem for companies like:

Banks
Healthcare companies
Government organizations
Because their data is sensitive.

Examples:
    Customer bank transactions
    Medical records
    Government data
    These companies cannot allow data to freely move into cloud environments because of compliance rules like:
    GDPR
    HIPAA
    SOC 2

this problem we called as -- “Data Sovereignty”
Meaning:
Data must stay inside a controlled/private environment.

